  "\"{label}\": hauling {dist} km eats ≈{sh} % of its energy value — build the plant at the source (rule of thumb: ≤ {be} km).": "„{label}“: transport over {dist} km spiser ≈{sh} % af dens energiværdi — byg anlægget ved kilden (tommelfingerregel: ≤ {be} km).",
